/4-3/","children":["← Back to Standard 4.3: Collaborator"]}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"page-intro","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["Standard 4.3 · Artifact One"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":["Listening to Educators"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-lede","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["Needs-Analysis Revision Record"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Trevor Arcadipane · Prepared September 26, 2026"]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"review-note","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["Purpose:"]}]," Use feedback to improve how I learn about educators’ formative-assessment needs. This is a revised planning resource, not a report of staff responses."]}]]}],"\n",["$","section",null,{"className":"content-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["From feedback to revision"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-card","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["In EDEL 590 Discussion 5.1, I proposed a short survey about formative assessment. A peer asked whether the first question would guide the choice of tools and whether it would be open-ended or multiple-choice. My instructor also asked about the response format. This record summarizes that feedback and presents my revised questions; it is not a transcript of the discussion."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"portfolio-table-wrap","children":[["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":["How the feedback shaped this version"]}],["$","thead",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":["Starting point"]}],["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":["Revision"]}],["$","th",null,{"scope":"col","children":["Purpose"]}]]}]]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":["\n",["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":["“How do you currently check student understanding?”"]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Use select-all choices and an “Other” response; ask about familiar tools separately."]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Distinguish the assessment practice from the platform and build on existing routines."]}]]}],"\n",["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":["Question format needed clarification."]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Combine brief choices with short written responses."]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Keep participation manageable while preserving the educator’s voice."]}]]}],"\n",["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":["The connection to future support needed explanation."]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Ask for one instructional priority and a preferred form of assistance."]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Let the educator’s need guide the support."]}]]}],"\n"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","section",null,{"className":"content-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Revised planning survey"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Suggested invitation: I’m planning practical support with quick checks for understanding. Please share what is useful in your classroom and where support would help. Skip any question you prefer; do not include student names or individual student records."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-card survey-questions","children":["\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["1. How do you currently check understanding?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Select all that apply: questioning or discussion; observation; paper exit tickets; short digital quizzes or polls; review of student work; self-assessment; other."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["Tools or platforms you already use, if any:"]}]]}],"\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["2. What would you most like help deciding?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Choose one: what to reteach; who needs additional support; who is ready to move ahead; how to give useful feedback; other."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["Brief example, if useful:"]}]]}],"\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["3. What helps your students access and complete a quick assessment?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Consider reading or language supports, response choices, device access, or directions. Describe one priority without identifying students."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["Your priority:"]}]]}],"\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["4. What makes digital formative assessment difficult?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Select all that apply: preparation time; interpreting responses; student focus; reading demands; technical access; privacy or account concerns; no major barrier; other."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["What should I understand about that barrier?"]}]]}],"\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["5. Which support would be most useful?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Choose up to two: a brief demonstration; planning one task together; time to practice with feedback; interpreting sample responses; a short reference guide; other."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["Any timing or format preference?"]}]]}],"\n",["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["6. What is one task or question you would like to work on together?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"response-line","children":["Your goal or question:"]}]]}],"\n"]}]]}],"\n",["$","section",null,{"className":"content-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Using the responses"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-card","children":[["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["Summarize the educator’s priority and ask whether I understood it correctly."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Agree on one lesson goal before choosing a tool or example."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Match support to the preferred format and identified access needs."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Set a follow-up to review the task and the educator’s feedback."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["Evidence to retain after use:"]}]," the agreed goal, the educator’s chosen support, the revision made, and a short reflection on what helped. Public portfolio evidence should omit identifying information."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["Current result:"]}]," clearer questions and a more specific plan for listening. Staff responses, a completed coaching cycle, and effects on teaching or learning remain to be collected."]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","nav",null,{"className":"page-pagination","aria-label":"Portfolio navigation","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/standards/4-3/","children":["← Back to Standard 4.3: Collaborator"]}]]}]]}]]}],"$Lc"]}]
